NAME                                     TYPE                        IS NULL 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
I1                                       INTEGER                     
I3                                       INTEGER                     NOT NULL
I4                                       INTEGER                     
[ INDEX ]                                                       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NAME                                     TYPE     IS UNIQUE     COLUMN
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
T1_PK                                    BTREE    UNIQUE        I3 ASC
T1_UK                                    BTREE    UNIQUE        I4 ASC
IDX1                                     BTREE                  I1 ASC
[ PRIMARY KEY ]                                                 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
